  triage:title "Task-event lookup compares as_str() == \"reminded\" instead of matching TaskEventKind::Reminded" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake_escalation.rs:96 and :102 find task events with event.event.as_str() == \"reminded\" against a string literal instead of matching the TaskEventKind::Reminded variant the enum was built for, discarding exhaustiveness and rename safety. Workspace sweep found only these two occurrences; no other .as_str() == comparisons against task-event or task-state string literals (reminded, blocked, completed, assigned, acked) in production code." ;
